    "Verapamil fasted F is close to the threshold (22%, 17-29%), so the margin is narrow.",
    "No query-specific oral AUC/Cmax, solubility, permeability, or metabolism data are available.",
    "L3 exposure records do not include an IV comparator for the query and cannot establish absolute F."
